00:08:56.520 --> 00:08:58.470
And that wasn't just
in the operation side,

00:08:58.470 --> 00:09:00.630
but also in the acquisition
support side of it as well.

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:02.610
They wanted us to have
the acquisition authority

00:09:02.610 --> 00:09:04.263
