00:19:39.600 --> 00:19:41.970
3%, 4%, somewhere in there I think.

00:19:41.970 --> 00:19:44.430
Are there paths to
influence to meet our needs,

00:19:44.430 --> 00:19:46.590
our security needs, our
defense related uses.

